Open Terminal: native OpenBB providers
Copyright 2026 The Open Terminal authors

This package contains TypeScript ports of data-provider code from the OpenBB
Platform (https://github.com/OpenBB-finance/OpenBB), Copyright (c) 2021-2026
OpenBB Inc., licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The provider
modules under src/<provider>/ were translated from the Python packages
openbb_<provider> (OpenBB 5.0.0) and modified: they return OpenBB's result
rows directly, without pydantic models, and run inside Open Terminal.

The yfinance provider (src/yfinance/) is not a port. It is an independent
implementation on top of yahoo-finance2 (MIT) that reproduces the output
schema of OpenBB's public API; the AGPL-licensed openbb-yfinance package was
not used as a source.

The route catalog in catalog/openbb.json is generated from the OpenAPI
document that OpenBB Platform 5.0.0 serves.

Third-party code
----------------
Besides OpenBB, some files are translations of other open source code. Each
names its source in its header comment, and each was modified: translated to
TypeScript, cut to the parts the ports use, and with Python's data structures
replaced by plain objects. The notices and licenses those projects require
follow.

